    "title_en": "Status of experiments with polarized deuteron target at VEPP-3 electron storage ring",
    "abstract_en": "A series of photonuclear experiments using a tensor-polarized deuteron target was performed at the VEPP-3 electron storage ring at the Budker Institute of Nuclear Physics. The internal target setup and schematics of the photon tagging and detection systems are described. Experimental data for the tensor analyzing power component T_20 are presented for coherent and incoherent π^0 photoproduction, π^- photoproduction, and deuteron photodisintegration. New results provide a rigorous benchmark for refining theoretical models in the intermediate energy regime.",
